# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS. Replace @your-org/security with a team of at least two people.
# With "Require review from Code Owners" enabled on main, a change to any of these paths
# cannot be merged without approval from the security team, and the platform, not the
# workflow under change, enforces it.
/.github/workflows/   @your-org/security
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @your-org/security
/gate/                @your-org/security
/policy/              @your-org/security
/exceptions/          @your-org/security
/ci/run-control.sh    @your-org/security
